     4	//!
     5	//! Successor of the repo's earlier `tp_roundtrip` example, plus
     6	//! in-process fill counters: each flavor's report ends with a
     7	//! `fills` line (cross-core cache-line fills per round trip)
     8	//! where the platform provides counters.
     9	
