    59	    /// numbers, e.g. `--pin 0,1`); omit to leave the scheduler
    60	    /// free
    61	    ///
    62	    /// Placement decides what the handoff costs: two cores
    63	    /// sharing an L3 (e.g. 0,1 on a Zen 2 CCX), cores in
    64	    /// different L3 domains (0,3), or SMT siblings sharing
    65	    /// L1/L2 (0,12 on a 3900X).
    66	    #[arg(long, value_name = "MAIN,WORKER", value_parser = parse_pin)]
    67	    pin: Option<(usize, usize)>,
